@startuml Delivery Acceptance and Closing

title Delivery, acceptance by Ukrainian customs, arrival and closing
caption Target design. Decisions O8, O9, O24, O10, O25, O11, D29. ADR 0015.

autonumber

actor "Convoy Leader" as leader
actor Dispatcher as disp
participant "Freedom API" as api
database "Freedom database" as db

== Delivery ==
leader -> api : mark vehicle delivered
api -> db : vehicle delivered; its remaining boxes Delivered
note right of leader
  The Convoy Leader or the Dispatcher may mark arrival (O8).
end note

== Acceptance, once per Ukrainian goods list ==
leader -> api : goods list for Receiver R on vehicle V **accepted**
group one transaction
  api -> db : every Delivered box for R on V -> Accepted
end
note right of api
  A photo to verify acceptance may be added later (O9).
end note

== Arrival ==
disp -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/arrive
api -> db : stamp the convoy row first
api -> db : every vehicle still travelling must be delivered
alt a vehicle is still travelling
  api --> disp : 409, names the vehicles
else all delivered
  api -> db : delivered vehicles handed over for good
  api --> disp : arrived
end

== Closing ==
disp -> api : POST /convoys/{id}/close
api -> db : ClosedAt
api --> disp : closing report
note right of disp
  Report: budget lines against actual costs; per vehicle,
  boxes by outcome with counts and value; vehicle values.
  Seized and undeliverable boxes are not delivered value.
  **No addresses or delivery detail.**
end note

== Corrections after closing ==
disp -> api : correct a cost or an outcome
api -> db : allowed: closing does not lock (O25)
disp -> api : GET /convoys/{id}/report
api --> disp : regenerated report

@enduml
